{"seq":2,"slug":"multiplatform-networking","title":"跨平台网络与序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/multiplatform-networking","wordCount":591,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨平台网络与序列化\">跨平台网络与序列化</h1><p>网络层是 KMP 项目中共享价值最高的部分——HTTP 请求逻辑、JSON 解析、错误处理在各平台完全相同，只有底层 HTTP 引擎需要平台适配。Ktor Client + kotlinx.serialization 的组合是 KMP 网络层的事实标准：Ktor 提供统一 API 和可插拔引擎架构，kotlinx.serialization 通过编译器插件实现零反射的高性能序列化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>KMP 网络层的架构采用&quot;统一接口 + 平台引擎&quot;模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph commonMain&#10;        A[Ktor HttpClient API] --&gt; B[kotlinx.serialization]&#10;        A --&gt; C[请求构建/响应解析]&#10;        A --&gt; D[拦截器/日志/重试]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 平台引擎&#10;        E[OkHttp Android]&#10;        F[Darwin iOS]&#10;        G[CIO JVM/Native]&#10;        H[JS/Wasm Browser]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    A --&gt; F&#10;    A --&gt; G&#10;    A --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph commonMain\n        A[Ktor HttpClient API] --&gt; B[kotlinx.serialization]\n        A --&gt; C[请求构建/响应解析]\n        A --&gt; D[拦截器/日志/重试]\n    end\n    subgraph 平台引擎\n        E[OkHttp Android]\n        F[Darwin iOS]\n        G[CIO JVM/Native]\n        H[JS/Wasm Browser]\n    end\n    A --&gt; E\n    A --&gt; F\n    A --&gt; G\n    A --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引擎</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>Artifact</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OkHttp</td>\n<td>Android/JVM</td>\n<td>连接池、HTTP/2、拦截器</td>\n<td><code>ktor-client-okhttp</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Darwin</td>\n<td>iOS/macOS</td>\n<td>使用 URLSession、系统证书</td>\n<td><code>ktor-client-darwin</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CIO</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>纯 Kotlin 实现、协程原生</td>\n<td><code>ktor-client-cio</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wasm/JS</td>\n<td>浏览器</td>\n<td>Fetch API 封装</td>\n<td><code>ktor-client-js</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ktor-client-配置与使用\">Ktor Client 配置与使用</h2><p>Ktor 3.x（2026 年当前版本）的 HttpClient 采用 DSL 配置，在 commonMain 中定义一次，各平台通过引擎选择自动适配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;val httpClient = HttpClient {&#10;    install(ContentNegotiation) {&#10;        json(Json {&#10;            ignoreUnknownKeys = true&#10;            isLenient = true&#10;            prettyPrint = false&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;    install(HttpTimeout) {&#10;        requestTimeoutMillis = 30_000&#10;        connectTimeoutMillis = 10_000&#10;    }&#10;    install(Logging) {&#10;        level = LogLevel.HEADERS&#10;    }&#10;    defaultRequest {&#10;        url(&quot;https://api.example.com/v2/&quot;)&#10;        header(&quot;X-Platform&quot;, getPlatformName())&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val httpClient = HttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install(ContentNegotiation) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        json(Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ignoreUnknownKeys = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isLenient = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            prettyPrint = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install(HttpTimeout) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        requestTimeoutMillis = 30_000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        connectTimeoutMillis = 10_000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    install(Logging) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        level = LogLevel.HEADERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        url(\"https://api.example.com/v2/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        header(\"X-Platform\", getPlatformName())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>引擎的选择通过依赖注入或 expect/actual 完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect fun createPlatformEngine(): HttpClientEngineFactory&lt;*&gt;&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual fun createPlatformEngine(): HttpClientEngineFactory&lt;*&gt; = OkHttp&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual fun createPlatformEngine(): HttpClientEngineFactory&lt;*&gt; = Darwin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun createPlatformEngine(): HttpClientEngineFactory&#x3C;*></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createPlatformEngine(): HttpClientEngineFactory&#x3C;*> = OkHttp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createPlatformEngine(): HttpClientEngineFactory&#x3C;*> = Darwin</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"kotlinx-serialization-跨平台序列化\">kotlinx.serialization 跨平台序列化</h2><p>kotlinx.serialization 的核心优势是编译时代码生成——通过 <code>@Serializable</code> 注解在编译期生成序列化器，无需运行时反射。这在 Kotlin/Native（无反射 API）上尤为关键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class UserResponse(&#10;    val id: Long,&#10;    val name: String,&#10;    val email: String,&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;created_at&quot;)&#10;    val createdAt: String,&#10;    val roles: List&lt;String&gt; = emptyList()&#10;)&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;sealed interface ApiResult&lt;out T&gt; {&#10;    @Serializable&#10;    data class Success&lt;T&gt;(val data: T) : ApiResult&lt;T&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Serializable&#10;    data class Error(val code: Int, val message: String) : ApiResult&lt;Nothing&gt;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class UserResponse(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val id: Long,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val email: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"created_at\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val createdAt: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val roles: List&#x3C;String> = emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface ApiResult&#x3C;out T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Success&#x3C;T>(val data: T) : ApiResult&#x3C;T></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Error(val code: Int, val message: String) : ApiResult&#x3C;Nothing></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 Gson/Moshi（仅 JVM）的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>kotlinx.serialization</th>\n<th>Gson</th>\n<th>Moshi</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多平台支持</td>\n<td>全部 KMP 目标</td>\n<td>仅 JVM</td>\n<td>仅 JVM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现方式</td>\n<td>编译时代码生成</td>\n<td>运行时反射</td>\n<td>注解处理器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>高（无反射开销）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空安全</td>\n<td>Kotlin 类型系统保证</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多态序列化</td>\n<td>sealed class 原生支持</td>\n<td>需自定义适配器</td>\n<td>需自定义适配器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"完整的-repository-模式\">完整的 Repository 模式</h2><p>将 Ktor 和 serialization 组合成一个类型安全的数据获取层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;class UserRepository(private val client: HttpClient) {&#10;&#10;    suspend fun getUser(id: String): User {&#10;        val response: UserResponse = client.get(&quot;users/$id&quot;).body()&#10;        return response.toDomain()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    suspend fun searchUsers(query: String, page: Int = 1): PaginatedResult&lt;User&gt; {&#10;        val response: PaginatedResponse&lt;UserResponse&gt; = client.get(&quot;users&quot;) {&#10;            parameter(&quot;q&quot;, query)&#10;            parameter(&quot;page&quot;, page)&#10;            parameter(&quot;per_page&quot;, 20)&#10;        }.body()&#10;        return response.toDomain { it.toDomain() }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    suspend fun updateUser(id: String, update: UserUpdate): User {&#10;        val response: UserResponse = client.put(&quot;users/$id&quot;) {&#10;            contentType(ContentType.Application.Json)&#10;            setBody(update)&#10;        }.body()&#10;        return response.toDomain()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserRepository(private val client: HttpClient) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getUser(id: String): User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val response: UserResponse = client.get(\"users/$id\").body()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return response.toDomain()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun searchUsers(query: String, page: Int = 1): PaginatedResult&#x3C;User> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val response: PaginatedResponse&#x3C;UserResponse> = client.get(\"users\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            parameter(\"q\", query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            parameter(\"page\", page)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            parameter(\"per_page\", 20)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }.body()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return response.toDomain { it.toDomain() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun updateUser(id: String, update: UserUpdate): User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val response: UserResponse = client.put(\"users/$id\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentType(ContentType.Application.Json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            setBody(update)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }.body()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return response.toDomain()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"错误处理与重试策略\">错误处理与重试策略</h2><p>网络请求的错误处理需要统一的跨平台策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;sealed interface NetworkError {&#10;    data class Http(val code: Int, val body: String) : NetworkError&#10;    data class Timeout(val url: String) : NetworkError&#10;    data class Connectivity(val cause: Throwable) : NetworkError&#10;    data class Serialization(val cause: Throwable) : NetworkError&#10;}&#10;&#10;suspend fun &lt;T&gt; safeApiCall(block: suspend () -&gt; T): Result&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    return try {&#10;        Result.success(block())&#10;    } catch (e: ClientRequestException) {&#10;        Result.failure(NetworkError.Http(e.response.status.value, e.message))&#10;    } catch (e: HttpRequestTimeoutException) {&#10;        Result.failure(NetworkError.Timeout(e.message ?: &quot;&quot;))&#10;    } catch (e: SerializationException) {&#10;        Result.failure(NetworkError.Serialization(e))&#10;    } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;        Result.failure(NetworkError.Connectivity(e))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface NetworkError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Http(val code: Int, val body: String) : NetworkError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Timeout(val url: String) : NetworkError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Connectivity(val cause: Throwable) : NetworkError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Serialization(val cause: Throwable) : NetworkError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun &#x3C;T> safeApiCall(block: suspend () -> T): Result&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Result.success(block())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: ClientRequestException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Result.failure(NetworkError.Http(e.response.status.value, e.message))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: HttpRequestTimeoutException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Result.failure(NetworkError.Timeout(e.message ?: \"\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: SerializationException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Result.failure(NetworkError.Serialization(e))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Result.failure(NetworkError.Connectivity(e))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[发起请求] --&gt; B{成功?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[解析 JSON]&#10;    C --&gt; D{解析成功?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[返回 Result.success]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[SerializationError]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| G{错误类型}&#10;    G --&gt;|HTTP 4xx/5xx| H[HttpError]&#10;    G --&gt;|超时| I[TimeoutError]&#10;    G --&gt;|无网络| J[ConnectivityError]&#10;    H --&gt; K{可重试?}&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt;|是 且次数未达上限| A&#10;    K --&gt;|否| L[返回 Result.failure]\">flowchart TD\n    A[发起请求] --&gt; B{成功?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[解析 JSON]\n    C --&gt; D{解析成功?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[返回 Result.success]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[SerializationError]\n    B --&gt;|否| G{错误类型}\n    G --&gt;|HTTP 4xx/5xx| H[HttpError]\n    G --&gt;|超时| I[TimeoutError]\n    G --&gt;|无网络| J[ConnectivityError]\n    H --&gt; K{可重试?}\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt;|是 且次数未达上限| A\n    K --&gt;|否| L[返回 Result.failure]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Ktor Client 提供统一的跨平台 HTTP API，通过可插拔引擎适配各平台底层网络栈</li>\n<li>kotlinx.serialization 使用编译时代码生成，支持全部 KMP 目标且无反射开销</li>\n<li>Repository 模式将网络 + 序列化封装为领域层可消费的类型安全接口</li>\n<li>统一的错误类型层次和重试策略确保各平台行为一致</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"expect-actual-mechanism\">expect/actual 机制</a>——HTTP 引擎选择背后的平台适配模式</li>\n<li><a href=\"multiplatform-persistence\">跨平台持久化</a>——网络数据的本地缓存方案</li>\n<li><a href=\"../android-development/networking-and-data/retrofit-and-okhttp\">Android 开发：Retrofit 与 OkHttp</a>——从 Retrofit 迁移到 Ktor 的参考</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨平台网络与序列化","id":"跨平台网络与序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Ktor Client 配置与使用","id":"ktor-client-配置与使用"},{"level":2,"text":"kotlinx.serialization 跨平台序列化","id":"kotlinx-serialization-跨平台序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"完整的 Repository 模式","id":"完整的-repository-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理与重试策略","id":"错误处理与重试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"expect/actual 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/expect-actual-mechanism"},"next":{"title":"跨平台持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/multiplatform-persistence"}}